{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22728","headline":"欲与元八卜邻先有是赠 · 白居易","name":"欲与元八卜邻先有是赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生心迹最相亲，欲隐墙东不爲身。\n明月好同三径夜，绿杨宜作两家春。\n每因暂出犹思伴，岂得安居不择邻。\n何独终身数相见，子孙长作隔墙人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22728.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22728","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}